                                                "sense_id": "e7cc19f4-ea13-31b6-98a3-b37d051cdfe4",
                                                "text": "Another part of my character is my need for organization and my love of lists, so I've decided to include, along with my reflections on siblinghood, a list of things to remember when dealing with a sibling with autism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af97e895-fea8-4e52-a0c6-55072d25d9d2",
